WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:46.480 --> 00:01:48.520
Someone once said:

00:01:49.550 --> 00:01:56.590
There are cabbages made from countless 
layers of thinly sliced cheese...

00:01:56.590 --> 00:01:59.930
The Cabbecheese!

00:02:01.260 --> 00:02:04.670
There are tomatoes which, when ripe,

00:02:04.670 --> 00:02:10.100
gush open with tons of 
sweet chocolate sauce...

00:02:10.600 --> 00:02:14.010
The Chocolatomato!

00:02:15.010 --> 00:02:17.780
The world is in the Gourmet Age!

00:02:17.780 --> 00:02:22.780
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:24.650 --> 00:02:28.320
The legendary Century Soup only 
appears once every hundred years.

00:02:28.920 --> 00:02:31.120
Barely surviving a fierce battle 
over capturing the soup,

00:02:31.120 --> 00:02:33.460
Toriko's group managed 
to beat the Gourmet Corp.

00:02:35.030 --> 00:02:37.960
Komatsu reunited with Toriko, who 
had wounds all over his body.

00:02:38.570 --> 00:02:41.400
But the final bit of the 
soup had been snatched away

00:02:41.400 --> 00:02:43.570
by the Gourmet Corp.'s GT Robot.

00:02:44.500 --> 00:02:47.210
However, Teppei squeezed out 
the Gourmet Show Window,

00:02:47.210 --> 00:02:49.940
and they managed to capture the final drop!

00:02:50.880 --> 00:02:52.850
The soup fell into Komatsu's cupped hands...

00:02:54.380 --> 00:02:56.980
After drinking the final drop,

00:02:56.980 --> 00:03:00.990
Komatsu promises to everyone that 
he will create the soup himself.

00:03:02.050 --> 00:03:05.590
Around then, feeling a fearsome 
presence even worse than Tommy's,

00:03:05.590 --> 00:03:08.730
Toriko and the others started 
evacuating Ice Mountain for real!

00:03:11.660 --> 00:03:14.200
The Gourmet Corp.'s Garçon, Alfaro!

00:03:14.730 --> 00:03:17.570
I won't let a single one of them escape.

00:03:17.940 --> 00:03:20.110
But, the one who stands against him is...

00:03:20.470 --> 00:03:24.780
You youngsters aren't getting any further!

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:34.350
Farewell, Ice Hell! Granny 
Setsu's Hidden Power!

00:03:37.520 --> 00:03:39.160
Check it out, all of you!

00:03:39.160 --> 00:03:42.130
It's a hidden cave, so there!

00:03:42.590 --> 00:03:43.460
T-This is...

00:03:43.460 --> 00:03:45.030
I can feel the air flowing...

00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:47.900
It's possible it connects to the outside!

00:03:47.900 --> 00:03:50.200
I told you it did earlier!

00:03:50.200 --> 00:03:52.400
Match-san, this is a great discovery!

00:03:52.400 --> 00:03:56.670
This was once a route for transporting 
ingredients... So, it's still here?

00:03:56.670 --> 00:03:57.940
How about it?

00:03:57.940 --> 00:04:02.580
I don't mind if you all feel 
the need to praise me a little.

00:04:02.580 --> 00:04:04.150
And all you have to do

00:04:04.150 --> 00:04:06.480
is to repay this debt of gratitude 
for the rest of your lives!

00:04:07.650 --> 00:04:09.050
Um, Zonge-sama...

00:04:09.990 --> 00:04:11.820
Man, what luck!

00:04:11.820 --> 00:04:14.490
We can all get back safely now!

00:04:14.490 --> 00:04:15.830
Hold it, people!

00:04:15.830 --> 00:04:17.790
Everyone praise my great accomplishment!

00:04:17.790 --> 00:04:20.200
Then get down on your knees, hey!

00:04:21.130 --> 00:04:24.070
You're feeling nice and chipper 
after the Knocking wore off...

00:04:24.070 --> 00:04:27.100
Man, that was some weird 
curse he put on me...

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:28.500
Um, it's not a curse...

00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:29.540
What?!

00:04:29.540 --> 00:04:30.410
Oh, never mind.

00:04:30.410 --> 00:04:32.410
Why'd it turn out like this?

00:04:33.510 --> 00:04:34.740
My scoop...

00:04:38.580 --> 00:04:42.280
Wait, hold it there, youngsters.

00:04:42.280 --> 00:04:43.650
S-Setsuno!

00:04:43.920 --> 00:04:46.390
Why is a living Gourmet 
National Treasure here?

00:04:48.860 --> 00:04:50.090
Well, well...

00:04:50.630 --> 00:04:54.300
It's cold! So, this is Ice Hell?

00:04:54.300 --> 00:04:57.370
I can even see my breath.

00:04:57.370 --> 00:04:59.070
See your breath?

00:04:59.070 --> 00:05:04.510
Is that not proof that your 
body has weakened, Setsuno-san?

00:05:07.110 --> 00:05:10.880
What exactly is a person like 
you doing in this place?

00:05:13.150 --> 00:05:17.550
Speaking like someone with authority 
now, aren't you, Alfaro?

00:05:17.950 --> 00:05:22.920
How is your Boss, that voracious fool?

00:05:23.990 --> 00:05:26.890
There are only a handful 
of people in the world

00:05:26.890 --> 00:05:29.800
who can speak of my boss in 
that manner, Setsuno-san.

00:05:30.830 --> 00:05:34.170
The Boss would surely be pleased

00:05:34.170 --> 00:05:36.940
if you were to join the 
kitchen of the Gourmet Corp.

00:05:38.540 --> 00:05:43.810
Sorry, but the ingredients I am after 
are not what that fool is searching for.

00:05:44.240 --> 00:05:46.450
The ingredients choose the customer.

00:05:46.650 --> 00:05:51.250
What? I simply came to pick 
up Toriko and the others.

00:05:51.250 --> 00:05:53.250
I have no business with you.

00:05:53.250 --> 00:05:59.260
Toriko? I see. So, if you are 
coming yourself to pick them up...

00:05:59.260 --> 00:06:02.160
If you understand, then don't 
think of doing anything stupid,

00:06:02.160 --> 00:06:04.500
and go back without any trouble.

00:06:38.100 --> 00:06:40.030
Put them away!

00:06:55.710 --> 00:06:56.810
Alfaro-sama!

00:07:01.190 --> 00:07:04.760
Oh, she hasn't lost a step after all.

00:07:04.760 --> 00:07:06.420
Let us go. She is not an opponent for us.

00:07:07.420 --> 00:07:08.360
Alfaro-sama!

00:07:08.890 --> 00:07:11.090
We will take Tommy with us and return.

00:07:11.730 --> 00:07:14.670
If that old woman wanted this soup,

00:07:14.670 --> 00:07:16.570
I really wouldn't be able to protect it.

00:07:16.570 --> 00:07:17.500
Let us hurry.

00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:18.070
Yes!

00:07:30.910 --> 00:07:33.520
Everyone, it's brighter up ahead!

00:07:33.520 --> 00:07:35.750
I can smell the ocean! It must be the exit!

00:07:35.750 --> 00:07:42.590
Yes, indeed! For this is the cave 
entrance that I discovered, yes, I!

00:07:44.090 --> 00:07:46.700
Hey, people! Listen to me!

00:08:01.340 --> 00:08:02.880
We're outside!

00:08:04.610 --> 00:08:06.480
We got out!

00:08:06.780 --> 00:08:10.720
See! I told you it connected outside!

00:08:10.720 --> 00:08:13.050
Hey, wait a second... The ship is gone!

00:08:13.390 --> 00:08:14.090
What?!

00:08:15.320 --> 00:08:16.160
What?

00:08:16.160 --> 00:08:18.490
Why are you looking at me now?

00:08:17.990 --> 00:08:19.130
I knew it...

00:08:18.490 --> 00:08:20.700
I didn't do anything!

00:08:20.700 --> 00:08:23.900
Look here, you owe me big time.

00:08:23.060 --> 00:08:26.400
E-Everyone! You see...

00:08:24.300 --> 00:08:27.200
And you'd better not forget it.

00:08:30.070 --> 00:08:35.180
"If he finds out there is no soup, he'll 
probably go home and leave us here."

00:08:35.610 --> 00:08:38.080
Yeesh... One more word out of him and 
the cat would've been out of the bag.

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:39.510
There's no soup here.

00:08:50.620 --> 00:08:55.230
I bet the Colonel listened 
in on us then, and...

00:08:55.230 --> 00:08:56.930
He left?!

00:08:56.930 --> 00:08:57.930
Probably...

00:08:57.930 --> 00:08:59.070
That old bastard...

00:08:59.070 --> 00:09:03.770
But, we're really stranded here?

00:09:03.770 --> 00:09:06.470
Then, we can't go back?!

00:09:06.470 --> 00:09:08.070
Only way back is to swim, then.

00:09:08.580 --> 00:09:09.410
Butterfly stroke.

00:09:09.410 --> 00:09:10.140
Not a chance!

00:09:10.140 --> 00:09:11.780
And what's the butterfly stroke?

00:09:17.020 --> 00:09:19.120
Everyone, sorry to keep you waiting!

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:19.990
Coco-san!

00:09:19.990 --> 00:09:20.890
Coco!

00:09:20.890 --> 00:09:25.160
Toriko... It really was quite 
a difficult battle, wasn't it?

00:09:25.160 --> 00:09:27.560
Another one of the Four Heavenly Kings!

00:09:27.560 --> 00:09:29.030
And, what's that?

00:09:34.370 --> 00:09:35.330
Don't tell me...

00:09:35.830 --> 00:09:37.900
A L-Limousine Jellyfish?

00:09:42.040 --> 00:09:43.710
Hey!

00:09:44.410 --> 00:09:46.980
I came to pick you up!

00:09:46.980 --> 00:09:48.050
Granny Setsu!

00:09:48.550 --> 00:09:51.180
You mean, the living Gourmet 
National Treasure?!

00:09:51.180 --> 00:09:53.080
Yes, it's Setsuno-san!

00:09:53.080 --> 00:09:55.550
Another big fish...

00:09:58.820 --> 00:10:01.090
You sure came out of a strange place...

00:10:01.660 --> 00:10:05.700
Without Coco's fortune telling, I 
wouldn't have been able to find you.

00:10:05.700 --> 00:10:07.930
Now hurry up and get on board!

00:10:07.930 --> 00:10:09.930
I bet you're all hungry!

00:10:09.930 --> 00:10:12.500
I've got a delicious feast waiting for you!

00:10:13.140 --> 00:10:14.310
Wait!

00:10:14.310 --> 00:10:15.370
Yay!

00:10:15.370 --> 00:10:16.410
Hey!

00:10:16.410 --> 00:10:18.740
What's with the old woman all of a sudden?

00:10:18.740 --> 00:10:20.680
Whatever, let's just hurry on quickly!

00:10:20.680 --> 00:10:22.050
They're going to leave us behind!

00:10:23.210 --> 00:10:25.650
It's a jellyfish over troubled waters!

00:10:25.650 --> 00:10:27.750
I think you mean boat, Zonge-sama...

00:10:28.250 --> 00:10:33.120
This is the first time I've ever seen 
such a bigwig of proper society...

00:10:34.790 --> 00:10:36.460
Man...

00:10:53.840 --> 00:10:56.050
Wow, this feels so amazing!

00:10:56.050 --> 00:10:57.580
Is this alive?

00:10:57.580 --> 00:10:58.780
Who knows?

00:10:58.780 --> 00:11:00.820
I've never seen a living 
thing like this before!

00:11:00.820 --> 00:11:04.350
It's a Limousine Jellyfish. Don't 
worry, it's definitely alive.

00:11:04.350 --> 00:11:05.520
Granny Setsu!

00:11:05.520 --> 00:11:08.320
It's warm inside, so come on in and rest up.

00:11:10.330 --> 00:11:11.990
What is this smell?

00:11:11.990 --> 00:11:14.030
Hey, Takimaru, we can eat!

00:11:14.030 --> 00:11:15.460
Toriko-san, you're drooling...

00:11:17.330 --> 00:11:19.200
Oh, wow!

00:11:19.200 --> 00:11:20.200
I'm in your debt...

00:11:23.840 --> 00:11:25.070
Thank you for the food!

00:11:25.070 --> 00:11:28.310
Go ahead, eat up!

00:11:41.820 --> 00:11:44.890
This is the most delicious 
thing I've ever eaten!

00:11:52.270 --> 00:11:53.400
Thank you very much.

00:12:03.180 --> 00:12:04.110
You're gonna kick the bucket

00:12:04.110 --> 00:12:06.350
before you get a chance to take your 
buddies back if you don't eat anything!

00:12:18.090 --> 00:12:20.790
Tina-san, why don't you eat?

00:12:20.790 --> 00:12:22.960
Don't you think the footage 
of the Century Soup

00:12:22.960 --> 00:12:25.330
would be plenty good enough news for...

00:12:25.330 --> 00:12:28.400
But... I didn't film a 
single gram of the soup!

00:12:30.270 --> 00:12:32.870
It's just that when I had 
this huge heaping helping

00:12:32.870 --> 00:12:34.670
of delicious smelling soup in front of me...

00:12:34.670 --> 00:12:38.080
Well, that's just how 
incredible the moment was!

00:12:38.080 --> 00:12:41.050
Now that I think about it, you 
missed scoops before too...

00:12:41.050 --> 00:12:45.320
Like what happened outside 
of the Puffer Whale cave,

00:12:45.320 --> 00:12:48.350
and the Jewel Meat being 
too bright to film, and...

00:12:48.350 --> 00:12:49.320
Komatsu-kun!

00:12:50.360 --> 00:12:51.690
I-I'm sorry!

00:12:52.160 --> 00:12:53.790
It's nothing to worry about.

00:12:53.790 --> 00:12:55.990
Failure is the mother of success.

00:12:55.990 --> 00:13:01.030
With your rare shamelessness 
and head-turning audacity,

00:13:01.030 --> 00:13:04.600
I am sure you will get good results, one day.

00:13:04.600 --> 00:13:07.010
That isn't cheering anyone up one bit!

00:13:07.010 --> 00:13:08.540
But that's Coco-san!

00:13:08.540 --> 00:13:10.680
She looks like she's been 
dealt the final blow.

00:13:11.880 --> 00:13:12.810
Oh?

00:13:12.810 --> 00:13:15.510
Not interested in my cooking?

00:13:15.980 --> 00:13:17.120
Of course I am!

00:13:17.120 --> 00:13:20.720
All these dishes from a living 
Gourmet National Treasure!

00:13:20.720 --> 00:13:23.490
I'll be sure to take all the scoops I can!

00:13:27.020 --> 00:13:27.590
Yum!

00:13:27.590 --> 00:13:30.030
What is this unique texture?

00:13:30.030 --> 00:13:32.260
It's Gorinira and liver sauté!

00:13:32.600 --> 00:13:33.630
Delicious!

00:13:35.800 --> 00:13:36.830
Yum!

00:13:36.830 --> 00:13:38.140
Don't eat it all!

00:13:38.140 --> 00:13:40.140
Leave some for us, Toriko-san!

00:13:40.140 --> 00:13:41.870
Ooh, this is delicious, too!

00:13:41.870 --> 00:13:42.570
It's true!

00:13:42.570 --> 00:13:44.880
Everything is so delicious!

00:13:48.710 --> 00:13:50.750
Thank you very much, Setsuno-san.

00:13:51.180 --> 00:13:56.850
It was none other than I who suggested 
you capture the Century Soup.

00:13:57.320 --> 00:13:59.620
But when I got word that the crucial

00:13:59.620 --> 00:14:02.530
Gourmet Show Window wasn't 
in such great shape,

00:14:02.530 --> 00:14:05.530
I requested an investigation to help you.

00:14:05.860 --> 00:14:09.600
But when I heard that the 
extra help hadn't left yet,

00:14:09.600 --> 00:14:12.230
I came here to Ice Hell myself 
with Coco, and what do I find...

00:14:12.230 --> 00:14:15.040
Teppei, why are you, the disciple, here?

00:14:16.910 --> 00:14:18.110
Not answering, are you?!

00:14:18.670 --> 00:14:21.880
Well, my master has his hands full

00:14:21.880 --> 00:14:25.610
reviving a really important 
ingredient right now...

00:14:25.610 --> 00:14:27.220
So he sent me instead...

00:14:27.780 --> 00:14:29.450
Important ingredient?

00:14:29.450 --> 00:14:31.590
And what ingredient is so important

00:14:31.590 --> 00:14:34.720
as to send his student on an 
investigation I requested?

00:14:34.720 --> 00:14:36.590
Yeah, well... Um...

00:14:41.760 --> 00:14:44.400
It's an ingredient related 
to the Gourmet God Acacia...

00:14:45.030 --> 00:14:46.940
But that's all I know.

00:14:50.000 --> 00:14:52.070
That eccentric fool...

00:14:52.070 --> 00:14:54.240
And? What of the Gourmet Show Window?

00:14:54.240 --> 00:14:55.080
Well...

00:14:55.610 --> 00:14:59.180
It was beyond help. Just 
as my master predicted.

00:14:59.880 --> 00:15:03.920
However, we managed to 
squeeze out the final drop.

00:15:05.350 --> 00:15:07.420
Must have been a terrible battle, everyone.

00:15:07.420 --> 00:15:08.990
Not at all!

00:15:08.990 --> 00:15:10.690
Now that I've eaten your food, Granny Setsu,

00:15:10.690 --> 00:15:12.590
I feel like I'm back to full strength!

00:15:12.660 --> 00:15:16.360
You know, you might be able 
to heal that arm of yours.

00:15:16.830 --> 00:15:17.660
Really?

00:15:17.660 --> 00:15:22.000
If you head to the the country 
of Life, there is a small chance.

00:15:23.400 --> 00:15:25.370
We have other severely wounded people.

00:15:25.370 --> 00:15:27.370
It would be best to head there immediately.

00:15:28.140 --> 00:15:31.580
And there is a talented 
Gourmet Reviver as well!

00:15:33.610 --> 00:15:37.020
I'm talking about the master 
of the laughing fool here.

00:15:37.320 --> 00:15:39.620
There are people who don't need to go,

00:15:39.620 --> 00:15:44.160
so while people are healing in Life, 
Komatsu-kun will make the soup!

00:15:44.160 --> 00:15:44.990
Isn't that right?

00:15:44.990 --> 00:15:47.630
Yes! I will make it, just you see!

00:15:47.630 --> 00:15:49.800
I'll make the real Century Soup!

00:15:51.660 --> 00:15:52.530
Good!

00:15:52.530 --> 00:15:54.370
Then, we're off!

00:15:54.370 --> 00:15:58.600
I'll take you there in 
this Limousine Jellyfish.

00:15:58.600 --> 00:16:01.570
We're heading toward the 
healing country, Life!

00:16:27.330 --> 00:16:34.470
Thank you... And bye-bye, Ice Hell!

00:16:45.180 --> 00:16:47.080
The healing country, Life.

00:16:47.080 --> 00:16:48.890
I've never been there before.

00:16:48.890 --> 00:16:52.560
Is it possible for my three 
men to open their eyes again?

00:16:52.560 --> 00:16:56.490
It's also true for Takimaru-san, but 
everyone was saved thanks to Ice Hell.

00:16:57.190 --> 00:17:02.400
The extreme cold froze their blood 
in an instant, preventing blood loss.

00:17:03.400 --> 00:17:04.900
Plus, after their hearts stopped,

00:17:04.900 --> 00:17:07.640
they slipped into a cold preservation 
state in a few seconds.

00:17:08.440 --> 00:17:11.670
You should be thankful that 
place is truly an icy cold hell.

00:17:12.740 --> 00:17:13.880
These bandages?

00:17:14.580 --> 00:17:16.650
Leaves of a plant called a Doctor Aloe.

00:17:17.210 --> 00:17:20.020
They can even treat cellular 
tissue that's entered necrosis.

00:17:20.020 --> 00:17:21.420
A natural bandage.

00:17:21.920 --> 00:17:22.890
Warm...

00:17:23.250 --> 00:17:27.890
I never thought that we mafia would 
ever be saved by a Gourmet Reviver.

00:17:27.890 --> 00:17:31.160
I've captured countless violent members 
of the Gourmet Mafia, it's true.

00:17:31.160 --> 00:17:35.000
But I haven't captured a single 
one from Ryu-san's group.

00:17:36.000 --> 00:17:37.630
You know my old man?

00:17:37.630 --> 00:17:40.600
Ryu-san and my master go way back.

00:17:41.100 --> 00:17:44.510
My old man is acquaintances with 
a Gourmet Reviver? Who knew...

00:17:44.510 --> 00:17:46.140
It's not so strange.

00:17:46.140 --> 00:17:49.710
Gourmet Revivers aren't some 
warriors of justice or anything.

00:17:49.710 --> 00:17:52.010
Our only ally is the ingredients themselves.

00:17:52.010 --> 00:17:54.950
We only capture those who 
defile the food chain.

00:17:55.880 --> 00:17:58.350
A little while ago, from an IGO request,

00:17:58.350 --> 00:18:01.360
we captured one of the Four Heavenly Kings...

00:18:01.420 --> 00:18:03.890
Wait, are you talking about Zebra?

00:18:03.890 --> 00:18:05.030
Wow...

00:18:05.030 --> 00:18:07.960
Well, my master helped 
out a little bit there.

00:18:07.960 --> 00:18:10.030
Zebra? That monster?

00:18:10.670 --> 00:18:13.940
Gourmet Reviver Teppei... He 
really is extremely talented.

00:18:14.870 --> 00:18:17.770
What, one of those striped horses? 
I've done in a bunch of them!

00:18:18.270 --> 00:18:20.940
That's right! Those striped horses 
are nothing before you, Zonge-sama!

00:18:20.940 --> 00:18:23.440
Yeah, a zebra is a striped horse, sure...

00:18:23.440 --> 00:18:25.280
Hey, everyone!

00:18:25.280 --> 00:18:27.150
We can see it now!

00:18:32.790 --> 00:18:35.120
That is the country of healing, Life.

00:18:53.470 --> 00:18:56.640
Butterfly Therapy (Insect 
Beast) Capture Level 1

00:18:55.170 --> 00:18:56.440
Butterfly Therapy!

00:18:57.110 --> 00:19:00.180
Butterflies that have a habit of landing

00:19:00.180 --> 00:19:02.950
on places of weakness or 
injury on people and animals.

00:19:02.950 --> 00:19:04.750
There's blue colored ones 
and red colored ones...

00:19:05.350 --> 00:19:09.220
The blue ones stop on light wounds, 
and the red on serious injuries.

00:19:09.660 --> 00:19:13.090
Both land on critically injured people.

00:19:13.560 --> 00:19:15.790
There isn't a single one 
landing on Zonge-sama...

00:19:15.790 --> 00:19:18.160
That's 'cause I'm always fit as a fiddle!

00:19:22.300 --> 00:19:23.540
Just red?

00:19:24.000 --> 00:19:25.270
Setsuno-san,

00:19:25.270 --> 00:19:28.770
I'm going to head right back to the 
hotel and start making that soup!

00:19:28.770 --> 00:19:30.940
I want to hurry and create that 
flavor as soon as I can...

00:19:30.940 --> 00:19:33.380
Not worried about resting 
at all here in Life?

00:19:37.820 --> 00:19:40.820
In the confusion, I ended up 
taking this little guy with us...

00:19:43.290 --> 00:19:44.220
Understood.

00:19:44.220 --> 00:19:46.920
Then, I will take you to 
the hotel, Komatsu-kun.

00:19:47.660 --> 00:19:49.360
Right! Thank you!

00:19:49.630 --> 00:19:50.760
Me, too.

00:19:51.160 --> 00:19:51.960
Tina-san?

00:19:52.800 --> 00:19:57.900
Chef Komatsu... Please let me 
film you as you create the soup!

00:19:58.800 --> 00:20:02.470
I won't film any part of the 
secret recipe, I promise!

00:20:02.940 --> 00:20:03.710
Please!

00:20:06.040 --> 00:20:06.910
Understood.

00:20:07.540 --> 00:20:10.210
I'll go report back to the IGO.

00:20:10.780 --> 00:20:11.820
I see.

00:20:11.820 --> 00:20:14.990
Teppei, guide Toriko and the others.

00:20:14.990 --> 00:20:19.760
I have to go to your master, as I 
intend to give him a good thrashing.

00:20:20.220 --> 00:20:21.360
Understood!

00:20:22.990 --> 00:20:25.430
I wonder which will happen first?

00:20:25.430 --> 00:20:29.630
Toriko's arm healing, or 
Komatsu-kun completing the soup?

00:20:32.000 --> 00:20:34.070
Komatsu... I'm counting on you!

00:20:34.300 --> 00:20:34.600
Right!

00:20:38.440 --> 00:20:40.210
Everyone, please wait for me!

00:20:40.540 --> 00:20:43.550
I'll definitely make the Century Soup!

00:20:44.050 --> 00:20:45.510
Good luck, Komatsu-kun.

00:20:45.980 --> 00:20:47.480
Show us your skills.

00:20:49.920 --> 00:20:51.550
Okay, let's go!

00:20:59.960 --> 00:21:01.760
The healing country, Life!

00:21:01.760 --> 00:21:03.970
This seems like a fun place!

00:21:15.380 --> 00:21:19.610
I'm grumble-grumble hungry! 
My tummy's rumble rumblin'!

00:21:20.680 --> 00:21:23.850
Today we're out there: Ack 
SOS, I'm in trouble yes!

00:21:23.850 --> 00:21:27.220
Gotta go! Gotta go! Can't 
leave this alone, right?

00:21:27.520 --> 00:21:30.690
Giving you support and cheer, 
the duties are endless!

00:21:30.690 --> 00:21:34.060
Burnin' up! Bustin' out! Trouble buster!

00:21:34.060 --> 00:21:37.130
Oh my god! A heaping helping of energy!

00:21:37.130 --> 00:21:40.900
When I'm hungry I can't get any power!

00:21:40.900 --> 00:21:44.470
Go, fight! At attention to you!

00:21:44.470 --> 00:21:47.610
Two-way communication!

00:21:47.610 --> 00:21:51.110
The encouragement I get 
from you is my nourishment!

00:21:51.380 --> 00:21:54.880
I want to eat lots of delicious things!

00:21:54.880 --> 00:21:58.250
Our future looks to be tasty!

00:21:58.250 --> 00:22:00.090
Right? OK. Left? OK.

00:22:00.090 --> 00:22:04.790
Be careful, courageously! Right on, let's go!

00:22:04.790 --> 00:22:08.360
Fight with bravery!

00:22:08.360 --> 00:22:12.070
Deli-deli delicious, and let's eat!

00:22:16.840 --> 00:22:18.370
Gourmet News!

00:22:19.740 --> 00:22:20.870
I'm your host, Tina!

00:22:21.440 --> 00:22:24.110
The Gorinira used in Setsuno's 
world famous dish,

00:22:24.110 --> 00:22:26.880
Gorinira liver sauté, 
requires special preparation!

00:22:27.650 --> 00:22:29.820
So instead we'll show you how

00:22:29.820 --> 00:22:33.250
to combine normal everyday nira 
to make a surprising dish!

00:22:33.650 --> 00:22:37.060
What you'll need is boiled 
nira, milk, and a banana!

00:22:37.060 --> 00:22:39.290
Blend them in a mixer, and...

00:22:42.560 --> 00:22:44.930
This tastes just like a melon shake!

00:22:45.230 --> 00:22:49.100
What? It's simpler just to drink 
a normal melon shake, you say?

00:22:51.100 --> 00:22:53.510
Yes! I know! I'm aware of that!

00:22:53.510 --> 00:22:56.310
But, using completely different 
ingredients to create the same taste

00:22:56.310 --> 00:22:59.910
is exactly how the new Century Soup will...

00:23:00.510 --> 00:23:02.210
Sorry, I lost my head there.

00:23:03.080 --> 00:23:04.720
Now then, on to the next story!

00:23:06.980 --> 00:23:08.490
He may be a rule-breaking wild man,

00:23:08.700 --> 00:23:10.240
but, his skills are first-rate!

00:23:10.550 --> 00:23:13.590
Life is the only place you can receive Yosaku-sensei’s treatment! {Check}

00:23:14.170 --> 00:23:16.960
Splendid Healing! Here Comes the Gourmet Reviver, Yosaku!

00:23:17.130 --> 00:23:18.910
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
